{"additionalPlain":"Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN)  is an equal employment opportunity employer. We comply with all applicable laws prohibiting discrimination based on race, color, religion, gender and gender expression/identity, age, ethnicity, national origin, ancestry, physical or mental disability, uniformed service member/veteran status, marital status, medical condition, pregnancy, sexual orientation, citizenship status, genetic information, as well as any other category protected by federal, state, or local. We are committed to building an inclusive workplace that values racial & social justice. We strongly encourage all persons to apply, including members from all racial and ethnic groups and members of the LGBTQIA+ community.  \n","additional":"<div>Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) &nbsp;is an equal employment opportunity employer. We comply with all applicable laws prohibiting discrimination based on race, color, religion, gender and gender expression/identity, age, ethnicity, national origin, ancestry, physical or mental disability, uniformed service member/veteran status, marital status, medical condition, pregnancy, sexual orientation, citizenship status, genetic information, as well as any other category protected by federal, state, or local.&nbsp;<b>We are committed to building an inclusive workplace that values racial &amp; social justice. We strongly encourage <u>all</u> persons to apply, including members from <u>all</u> racial and ethnic groups and members of the LGBTQIA+ community.</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","department":"Patient Access","location":"Remote","team":"Supervisors","allLocations":["Remote"]},"createdAt":1639762174563,"descriptionPlain":"The vision of Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) is to support the mission and promise of Planned Parenthood to bring high-quality, affordable care to every member of our communities. CHN is a collaboration between Planned Parenthood affiliates across the United States.  \n\nCHN is looking for individuals who are committed to supporting our shared goal of strengthening and enhancing our awareness and commitment to advancing the cause of health equity in our organization.\n\n\nThe Patient Access Supervisor is responsible for daily operations and specific administrative functions within the Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) Call Center team in Patient Access. This includes the responsibility for successfully fielding and resolving a large volume of inquiries via phone and other potential contact methods within the Patient Access Center, day-to-day support of staff, working messages to/from health centers, and managing incoming and outgoing phone calls. The supervisor will assist with frontline service delivery. The supervisor will be readily available to provide team members with the tools and training needed to meet established service goals. In addition to supporting employees and direct service delivery, the supervisor will act as a single point of contact for initial communication with interdependent functions regarding the Call Center within Patient Access. As such, they are responsible for facilitating bidirectional communication between frontline staff, other Patient Access Center functions, and leadership. As a leader, the supervisor encourages a patient focused, cost-effective, and high-quality environment for all front-line interactions. The Patient Access Supervisor reports directly to the Patient Access Manager. \n","description":"<div>The vision of Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) is to support the mission and promise of Planned Parenthood to bring high-quality, affordable care to every member of our communities. CHN is a collaboration between <b>Planned Parenthood affiliates across the United States.  </b></div><div><br></div><div>CHN is looking for individuals who are committed to supporting our shared goal of strengthening and&nbsp;<b>enhancing our awareness and commitment to advancing the cause of health equity&nbsp;</b>in our organization.</div><div><br></div><div><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The Patient Access Supervisor is responsible for daily operations and specific administrative functions within the Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) Call Center team in Patient Access. This includes the responsibility for successfully fielding and resolving a large volume of inquiries via phone and other potential contact methods within the Patient Access Center, day-to-day support of staff, working messages to/from health centers, and managing incoming and outgoing phone calls. The supervisor will assist with frontline service delivery. The supervisor will be readily available to provide team members with the tools and training needed to meet established service goals. In addition to supporting employees and direct service delivery, the supervisor will act as a single point of contact for initial communication with interdependent functions regarding the Call Center within Patient Access. As such, they are responsible for facilitating bidirectional communication between frontline staff, other Patient Access Center functions, and leadership. As a leader, the supervisor encourages a patient focused, cost-effective, and high-quality environment for all front-line interactions. The Patient Access Supervisor reports directly to the Patient Access Manager.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></div>","id":"970e4dc4-7a2c-4c74-b187-1dafa2c73c15","lists":[{"text":"Essential Functions ","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Supervise a team of Patient Access Representatives to ensure all administrative and technical functions of the Patient Access Center are being handled efficiently and effectively</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Serve as the knowledge expert and information resource for team members</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain competence and use critical thinking skills to promptly resolve patient inquiries that include:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Assisting patients with identifying a provider and scheduling appointments appropriate to the care needed</span> </li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Offering prompt assistance to patients for a variety of services that are not limited to</span></li>\n\n\n\n</ul></li></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reproductive health care and abortion services</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Providing price estimates for scheduled and unscheduled services&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Screening for financial assistance programs</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Booking, canceling, and rescheduling appointments&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Addressing patient escalations and effectively seeing them through to resolution&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Wingdings\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:2160,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Wingdings&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9642],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"3\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Relaying patient communications to provider</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Monitor and report on service performance, including volumes, wait times, abandonment rates, and other core productivity and performance measures in real-time and retrospective</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reach service goals through targeted approach; report performance weaknesses; record data, evaluate performance, and assess opportunities for improvement</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain strong communication and working relationships with patients, staff, and clinical teams</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Recommend policies and procedures for the department. Update current policy and procedure manuals as required. Apprise staff of changes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Monitor and report key metrics</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Communicate and operationalize vision; encourage cooperative and customer-focused employee culture</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Audit performance and provide education to frontline team members to maintain or exceed accuracy standards and communicate these efforts to the quality and training teams to identify and enhance new hire and ongoing training and quality efforts</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work collaboratively with affiliates on issues related to appointment scheduling</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Represent the department in meetings and on committees for root cause analysis related to scheduling issues</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work with managers to provide coaching and ensure team members are equipped with the tools and training needed to meet accuracy standards, productivity, and customer service goals</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provides training to Patient Access Representatives, as needed</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrate a commitment to CHN and Planned Parenthood’s mission related to health equity, especially centering racial equity, and deep sense of accountability to community</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrate a commitment to learning about and enhancing practices related to racial equity and the impact of structural racism on healthcare systems</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work and build trust across cultural differences</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Manage and mentor a culturally diverse team, including creating and sustaining an organizational culture that fosters inclusiveness and equity</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide positive and development feedback and accountability related to practices including, but not limited to, equity</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:580,&quot;335559738&quot;:135,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:361}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The above duties and responsibilities are not an exhaustive list of required responsibilities, duties, and skills. Other duties may be added, and this job description can be amended at any time.</span></em></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Qualifications and Experience (Required)","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Associate</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\"> degree and/or higher-level education</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">completed coursework in business or health services administration, or equivalent experience</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Two years or more experience in healthcare contact centers, pre-access, patient access, admissions or hospital business office, or physician practice office</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Prior supervisory or Team Lead experience&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Customer focus and adaptability to different personality types</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Ability to multi-task, set priorities, and manage time effectively</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">English language </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">proficiency</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"13\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Body Text\">Demonstrated dedication to Planned Parenthood’s mission, vision, and values</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:130,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Qualifications and Experience (Preferred )","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:580,&quot;335559991&quot;:361,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"0\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor’s degree strongly preferred in Health Care Administration, or in a related field&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:580,&quot;335559991&quot;:361,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">2+ years of relevant experience at the leadership level</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:580,&quot;335559991&quot;:361,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with EPIC EMR/EHR</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551671&quot;:0,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:580,&quot;335559991&quot;:361,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Working-level secondary language proficiency</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n\n</ul></div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Key Requirements ","content":"<div>\n\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Commitment to advancing race(+) equity in one’s work: interested in expanding knowledge about the role that racial inequity plays in our society</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Awareness of multiple group identities and their dynamics, bringing a high level of self-awareness about personal identity, empathy, and humility to interpersonal interactions</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Demonstrated ability to communicate clearly and directly as well as hear and act on feedback related to identity and equity with the aim to learn</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Strong sense of accountability to equitable practices</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Understanding of the impact of identity dynamics on organizational culture</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: revert;\">Commitment to CHN and Planned Parenthood’s In This Together service ethos, workplace values, and service standards</li>\n\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"currency":"USD","interval":"per-hour-wage","min":25,"max":38},"salaryDescription":"<div>\n<div><strong>CHN believes in fair and equitable pay.</strong>&nbsp;Above is the pay range for this role. Please note that actual salaries may vary within the range, based on factors including, but not limited to, education, training, experience, professional achievement, and business need.<em>Placement higher in the range is typically reserved for candidates with extensive, directly related experience and a demonstrated record of exceptional expertise.</em></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>CHN provides employees with a&nbsp;<strong>competitive benefits package</strong>; some highlights include the following:</div>\n<div>- Health Care Coverage (Medical, Dental, &amp; Vision); eligibility for full-time, regular employees on date of hire&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Flexible Spending Accounts and Health Savings Account&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Short-Term Disability and Basic Life &amp; AD&amp;D Insurance provided by CHN&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Voluntary elections for Long Term Disability and Additional Life &amp; AD&amp;D Insurance available at cost&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Employee Assistance Program&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Retirement Plan, 3% employer match after one year of service&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>- Paid Time Off Program includes accrual-based PTO, Health Time Off (HTO), and nine (9) paid Holidays&nbsp;</div>\n</div>","salaryDescriptionPlain":"CHN believes in fair and equitable pay. Above is the pay range for this role. Please note that actual salaries may vary within the range, based on factors including, but not limited to, education, training, experience, professional achievement, and business need.Placement higher in the range is typically reserved for candidates with extensive, directly related experience and a demonstrated record of exceptional expertise.\n \nCHN provides employees with a competitive benefits package; some highlights include the following:\n- Health Care Coverage (Medical, Dental, & Vision); eligibility for full-time, regular employees on date of hire \n- Flexible Spending Accounts and Health Savings Account \n- Short-Term Disability and Basic Life & AD&D Insurance provided by CHN \n- Voluntary elections for Long Term Disability and Additional Life & AD&D Insurance available at cost \n- Employee Assistance Program \n- Retirement Plan, 3% employer match after one year of service  \n- Paid Time Off Program includes accrual-based PTO, Health Time Off (HTO), and nine (9) paid Holidays \n","text":"Patient Access Supervisor","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div>The vision of Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) is to support the mission and promise of Planned Parenthood to bring high-quality, affordable care to every member of our communities. CHN is a collaboration between <b>Planned Parenthood affiliates across the United States.  </b></div><div><br></div><div>CHN is looking for individuals who are committed to supporting our shared goal of strengthening and&nbsp;<b>enhancing our awareness and commitment to advancing the cause of health equity&nbsp;</b>in our organization.</div>","openingPlain":"The vision of Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) is to support the mission and promise of Planned Parenthood to bring high-quality, affordable care to every member of our communities. CHN is a collaboration between Planned Parenthood affiliates across the United States.  \n\nCHN is looking for individuals who are committed to supporting our shared goal of strengthening and enhancing our awareness and commitment to advancing the cause of health equity in our organization.\n","descriptionBody":"<div><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">The Patient Access Supervisor is responsible for daily operations and specific administrative functions within the Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) Call Center team in Patient Access. This includes the responsibility for successfully fielding and resolving a large volume of inquiries via phone and other potential contact methods within the Patient Access Center, day-to-day support of staff, working messages to/from health centers, and managing incoming and outgoing phone calls. The supervisor will assist with frontline service delivery. The supervisor will be readily available to provide team members with the tools and training needed to meet established service goals. In addition to supporting employees and direct service delivery, the supervisor will act as a single point of contact for initial communication with interdependent functions regarding the Call Center within Patient Access. As such, they are responsible for facilitating bidirectional communication between frontline staff, other Patient Access Center functions, and leadership. As a leader, the supervisor encourages a patient focused, cost-effective, and high-quality environment for all front-line interactions. The Patient Access Supervisor reports directly to the Patient Access Manager.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"The Patient Access Supervisor is responsible for daily operations and specific administrative functions within the Clinical Health Network for Transformation (CHN) Call Center team in Patient Access. This includes the responsibility for successfully fielding and resolving a large volume of inquiries via phone and other potential contact methods within the Patient Access Center, day-to-day support of staff, working messages to/from health centers, and managing incoming and outgoing phone calls. The supervisor will assist with frontline service delivery. The supervisor will be readily available to provide team members with the tools and training needed to meet established service goals. In addition to supporting employees and direct service delivery, the supervisor will act as a single point of contact for initial communication with interdependent functions regarding the Call Center within Patient Access. As such, they are responsible for facilitating bidirectional communication between frontline staff, other Patient Access Center functions, and leadership. As a leader, the supervisor encourages a patient focused, cost-effective, and high-quality environment for all front-line interactions. The Patient Access Supervisor reports directly to the Patient Access Manager. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/ClinicalHealthNetworkForTransformation/970e4dc4-7a2c-4c74-b187-1dafa2c73c15","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/ClinicalHealthNetworkForTransformation/970e4dc4-7a2c-4c74-b187-1dafa2c73c15/apply"}